{
 "_note": "BUILT by lauren-agent-hub-data/scripts/build_training_audio.py from docs/team/training.json — do not edit. lines: exact spoken text → file (+ length). The page plays these with <audio>; a line missing here falls back to the device voice and the guardrail goes red.",
 "voice": "af_heart",
 "speed": 1.0,
 "music": {
  "file": "music-bed-v1.mp3"
 },
 "lines": {
  "Nice to Meet You!": {
   "file": "45c40ca50fd47a60.mp3",
   "ms": 1464
  },
  "Hi, and welcome! You just joined The Makeup Blowout Sale, and we are so happy you are here.": {
   "file": "dbed70fe89a92ff5.mp3",
   "ms": 5568
  },
  "So, what do we do? We are a traveling beauty sale. Almost every weekend we open a giant sale in a different city in the United States.": {
   "file": "49029d45a5b767c6.mp3",
   "ms": 8328
  },
  "Makeup, hair, skin care and perfume, from great brands, at prices people can't believe.": {
   "file": "b4ef19b96cccd4f5.mp3",
   "ms": 5928
  },
  "Thousands of women come to every event, looking for great beauty at a great price.": {
   "file": "7138229cebd43cf0.mp3",
   "ms": 4968
  },
  "And you are part of the team that makes it happen. This first course shows you how it all works, step by step, before your first event.": {
   "file": "c95b3b57838c6421.mp3",
   "ms": 7920
  },
  "Watch each video to the end, and answer one quick question to unlock the next one.": {
   "file": "178d96a3d5e3fc69.mp3",
   "ms": 5232
  },
  "An Event Weekend": {
   "file": "37e19693790b1777.mp3",
   "ms": 1416
  },
  "Every event is one long weekend, and it always has the same rhythm.": {
   "file": "8019b0f9614c630f.mp3",
   "ms": 4272
  },
  "Thursday is setup day. The team arrives, the truck is unloaded, and we build the whole sale inside the event room.": {
   "file": "f6bd4f69a7339d43.mp3",
   "ms": 7296
  },
  "Friday, Saturday and Sunday are the sale. The doors open, the guests come in, and we are on the floor all day.": {
   "file": "f18c9921d33c6757.mp3",
   "ms": 7224
  },
  "On Sunday, when the sale closes, we break everything down, pack it correctly, and load it back on the truck.": {
   "file": "6fff7129dc05dd4c.mp3",
   "ms": 6456
  },
  "Then everybody goes home, and the truck drives on to the next city.": {
   "file": "af7dc3880f4063f3.mp3",
   "ms": 4032
  },
  "So when you see an event on your schedule, remember: your weekend starts on Thursday.": {
   "file": "7f5a61379dda11da.mp3",
   "ms": 4800
  },
  "Flights, Rides & Hotel": {
   "file": "e92c41631d1f92a4.mp3",
   "ms": 1944
  },
  "Many of our events are far from home. When they are, the company books your flight and your hotel room for you.": {
   "file": "851a9151e4187a16.mp3",
   "ms": 6504
  },
  "When your flight details arrive, check right away that your name and all the details are correct.": {
   "file": "1a315072bd09cbb0.mp3",
   "ms": 5424
  },
  "Rides to and from the airport go on the company Uber account. Your manager will explain how it works.": {
   "file": "2bfdaa975aba3162.mp3",
   "ms": 6336
  },
  "At the hotel you share a room with one teammate. Girls room with girls, and boys room with boys.": {
   "file": "f25715f441f082cc.mp3",
   "ms": 5952
  },
  "Live close to the event? Then you sleep at home, and come to the event room on time.": {
   "file": "0951f9dbbc7653b6.mp3",
   "ms": 4944
  },
  "Pack for the whole weekend, Thursday to Sunday, and get a good night's sleep before every event day.": {
   "file": "0afb177d7306dfef.mp3",
   "ms": 5784
  },
  "Inside the Event Room": {
   "file": "2494777d3708d86e.mp3",
   "ms": 1632
  },
  "Let's walk into the event room. On Thursday morning it is empty. By Friday it is a full beauty sale.": {
   "file": "ab5d90cc5ecc35d2.mp3",
   "ms": 6600
  },
  "The products arrive on the truck, on pallets and in boxes. We bring them in and set up long tables.": {
   "file": "4000ffcf02471d07.mp3",
   "ms": 6144
  },
  "Every table has its own brand, or its own kind of product. You will get to know names like Market, She, Amuse and Beauty Creation, and the tables for hair, skin care and perfume.": {
   "file": "b23f977ecb64d648.mp3",
   "ms": 11544
  },
  "On the table, the products stand in displays, so guests can see every color and pick what they love.": {
   "file": "3fb29331f0fae4a6.mp3",
   "ms": 5952
  },
  "Extra products wait under the tables and in the back of the room. We call that back stock.": {
   "file": "fdc149d81a55564c.mp3",
   "ms": 5208
  },
  "Bright neon signs show the prices and the deals. A clear sign helps the guest, and helps the sale.": {
   "file": "b7b2818ecfc40585.mp3",
   "ms": 6216
  },
  "And at the registers, guests pay for everything they picked, with cash or with a card.": {
   "file": "e1f6a18e363ba2e5.mp3",
   "ms": 4944
  },
  "Words You Will Hear": {
   "file": "f831da191aae69d8.mp3",
   "ms": 1368
  },
  "Every team has its own language. Here are the words you will hear on the floor from day one.": {
   "file": "516bfe08d5eecc25.mp3",
   "ms": 5280
  },
  "Refill: when a display starts to look empty, you fill it up again from the back stock.": {
   "file": "008b4088b78cf46d.mp3",
   "ms": 5040
  },
  "Tester: one open product that guests can try. It is marked with a round neon tester sticker.": {
   "file": "7ceb3fd3ad002976.mp3",
   "ms": 6240
  },
  "Go-backs: products that guests left in the wrong place, or decided not to buy. They go back to their own table.": {
   "file": "dff1f59e314b487a.mp3",
   "ms": 6888
  },
  "Low stock: a product that is almost gone. One of the next videos shows you exactly what to do about it.": {
   "file": "450eeb9270380edc.mp3",
   "ms": 6480
  },
  "The count report, also called Recount: the list where the team updates how many pieces are left of each product.": {
   "file": "100dc6631d300a84.mp3",
   "ms": 7056
  },
  "The opening talk: a short team meeting with your manager, right before the doors open.": {
   "file": "a44a04bce38f5def.mp3",
   "ms": 5376
  },
  "And the Mystery Box: a surprise box filled with beauty products.": {
   "file": "7ad4f40a3c4f56e2.mp3",
   "ms": 4104
  },
  "Who Is Who": {
   "file": "4e14fd48ea3c23b9.mp3",
   "ms": 1272
  },
  "You are never alone at an event. Let's meet the team around you.": {
   "file": "f97fb72fdafdc4e1.mp3",
   "ms": 3792
  },
  "Every event has an event manager. The manager runs the weekend, and is your first address for any question and any problem.": {
   "file": "20d07aac193ee65f.mp3",
   "ms": 7728
  },
  "The logistics manager takes care of the truck, and helps make setup and breakdown smooth and safe.": {
   "file": "a02ccb3818216309.mp3",
   "ms": 5880
  },
  "Lauren and Eli are the owners of the company. Sometimes you will meet them at an event.": {
   "file": "c8e1ee744f91da12.mp3",
   "ms": 5424
  },
  "The team also has a WhatsApp group, for important updates and links during the event.": {
   "file": "fb5e7aef972dab9a.mp3",
   "ms": 5088
  },
  "At your first events, your manager and your teammates teach you everything: the brands, the tables, the refills, and when the time is right, the register.": {
   "file": "d410f0ebebed551c.mp3",
   "ms": 8904
  },
  "Nobody expects you to know everything on day one. If you are not sure, ask. Asking is always the right move.": {
   "file": "fa4d7213fef53c43.mp3",
   "ms": 7008
  },
  "Your First Event": {
   "file": "f1abbb517c2922e7.mp3",
   "ms": 1416
  },
  "Almost there! Here is what happens around your very first event.": {
   "file": "2d7b22d6e6f0caf4.mp3",
   "ms": 3816
  },
  "Your uniform: the company gives you two company shirts and a jacket, in the sizes you just told us.": {
   "file": "d3a3376ea3ae199f.mp3",
   "ms": 6360
  },
  "You get them from your manager at your first event, and you sign a short form for them.": {
   "file": "2979dbf6d1c65f13.mp3",
   "ms": 4632
  },
  "Until you have your uniform, a plain black shirt is perfect. And if you ever leave the company, the uniform comes back to us.": {
   "file": "aba06c794e3c96c9.mp3",
   "ms": 7536
  },
  "Your schedule: when you finish all the videos, you get your own schedule, with the events you are booked on.": {
   "file": "958ec378d779370a.mp3",
   "ms": 5952
  },
  "Next comes the Crew Training: the rules every teammate follows, at every event. Watch them all, and you are ready.": {
   "file": "2efd61f6e92ca196.mp3",
   "ms": 6792
  },
  "We are so glad you joined us. See you at your first event!": {
   "file": "1f76d184bafe4433.mp3",
   "ms": 3552
  },
  "Welcome to the Team!": {
   "file": "75aeacab31319b23.mp3",
   "ms": 1512
  },
  "Hey you! Welcome to The Makeup Blowout Sale.": {
   "file": "e7308e7c9e06f9f7.mp3",
   "ms": 2808
  },
  "We run giant beauty sales all over the United States. Makeup, hair, skin care, perfume, all at crazy prices.": {
   "file": "1756158d9bf22067.mp3",
   "ms": 7680
  },
  "Every weekend thousands of women walk into our room, and every one of them should feel welcome.": {
   "file": "fad0e1353779146a.mp3",
   "ms": 5400
  },
  "The little things make a great event: clean tables, full displays, clear signs, a big smile.": {
   "file": "c8a26c9841bc48ce.mp3",
   "ms": 5928
  },
  "These short videos are the rules of our team. Watch each one to the end and answer one quick question to unlock the next.": {
   "file": "761e669551e70fd1.mp3",
   "ms": 7488
  },
  "Be On Time": {
   "file": "188e037eebe31098.mp3",
   "ms": 1320
  },
  "Rule number one: be on time. Being on time is the definition of integrity.": {
   "file": "5bf847bab4fccac0.mp3",
   "ms": 5088
  },
  "When you show up when you said you would, people can trust you.": {
   "file": "d700b6f08ecdb127.mp3",
   "ms": 3264
  },
  "Get a good night's sleep and come ready, so we open the event with no pressure and good vibes.": {
   "file": "982076661a6fde02.mp3",
   "ms": 5448
  },
  "Flights: check that your name and details are spelled correctly on every week you are booked.": {
   "file": "aa1d9cbbc5b6ec04.mp3",
   "ms": 5184
  },
  "Plan your ride and be at the airport at least one hour before departure.": {
   "file": "13174d73ce3ff20c.mp3",
   "ms": 4224
  },
  "If you miss a flight, the cost of a new flight, or an Uber to another airport, comes out of your bonus. So please, don't be late!": {
   "file": "1f8253bdc737071e.mp3",
   "ms": 7776
  },
  "Look the Part": {
   "file": "3f111869195464c4.mp3",
   "ms": 1320
  },
  "Always wear the company uniform: the T-shirt or hoodie, or a black shirt.": {
   "file": "931a364994c3bec2.mp3",
   "ms": 4752
  },
  "That way every guest knows you work here and can ask you for help.": {
   "file": "4e9ed9e10afe74cc.mp3",
   "ms": 3768
  },
  "Wear your pouch, and keep four things in it all day long:": {
   "file": "46e3b25687df703a.mp3",
   "ms": 3096
  },
  "A knife, tape, tester stickers, and a sharpie.": {
   "file": "0ffab60cf5c45a37.mp3",
   "ms": 2952
  },
  "Take care of your personal hygiene, and if anything from your uniform is missing, tell your manager.": {
   "file": "cf063ab2e03cfb5d.mp3",
   "ms": 5952
  },
  "Guests Come First": {
   "file": "726867efa0f68ede.mp3",
   "ms": 1512
  },
  "Greet every guest with a big Welcome! and offer her a bag.": {
   "file": "e929655577739754.mp3",
   "ms": 3672
  },
  "Be helpful with questions and requests. Great customer service is what we are known for.": {
   "file": "42ce2d9a78cd122d.mp3",
   "ms": 5616
  },
  "But when the room is packed, keep conversations short. There is a lot to do on the floor.": {
   "file": "fc32a37176d46016.mp3",
   "ms": 5016
  },
  "Be respectful to every guest, and just as respectful to your teammates.": {
   "file": "5904463ffc78c5e0.mp3",
   "ms": 4248
  },
  "All Tables, All of Us": {
   "file": "168baf7777e9cb81.mp3",
   "ms": 1800
  },
  "At setup, each of us sets up our own tables. But during the event, every table belongs to the whole team.": {
   "file": "90632ef64d93fcc6.mp3",
   "ms": 6576
  },
  "Stay alert, walk between all the tables, and refill what's missing, even on a table you didn't set up. Filling the displays is everyone's job, equally.": {
   "file": "ffee58f1da16e7b0.mp3",
   "ms": 9456
  },
  "Keep every table clean and refilled. Refills are how we maximize sales, so never let a color or item go missing.": {
   "file": "becf02110cd596f7.mp3",
   "ms": 7728
  },
  "Something sold out? Put something else in its place, and check the back of the room and the truck for more.": {
   "file": "98ae86b38a9baf46.mp3",
   "ms": 5664
  },
  "Go-backs only when the room is not busy, and the floor manager announces it.": {
   "file": "44fc68d2b619a753.mp3",
   "ms": 4584
  },
  "Testers, labels, prices and stickers always up to date.": {
   "file": "72c6bf85c5a55117.mp3",
   "ms": 3936
  },
  "And signs! Bright neon with clear black sharpie. The clearer the sign, the better the sales!": {
   "file": "b92eab191e27d3a5.mp3",
   "ms": 5592
  },
  "Low Stock Alert": {
   "file": "8391ef7eaa920ea2.mp3",
   "ms": 1440
  },
  "Low stock means less than one display, or less than six pieces.": {
   "file": "b697b30596c7781d.mp3",
   "ms": 4104
  },
  "First make sure there is no more in the truck or in the extra inventory in the room.": {
   "file": "683fba9c61ce8afa.mp3",
   "ms": 4800
  },
  "Once you are sure, open the RECOUNT count report. The link is in the team WhatsApp group, and it is updated every week.": {
   "file": "4f6a4e2ef0c50ed0.mp3",
   "ms": 7512
  },
  "Search for the product in the report.": {
   "file": "20017b3227705f90.mp3",
   "ms": 2184
  },
  "And update the quantity that is left.": {
   "file": "d65554067cf9f9df.mp3",
   "ms": 2280
  },
  "Every product in the report has to be counted during the weekend. Otherwise the system is not up to date, and products will be missing the next week.": {
   "file": "d7043ceb802e490d.mp3",
   "ms": 8640
  },
  "A color that just doesn't sell? Bring it to your manager, it goes back for the Mystery Box.": {
   "file": "9023a738edc718eb.mp3",
   "ms": 5376
  },
  "Opening Talk & Phones": {
   "file": "79b5fe211618a0a7.mp3",
   "ms": 1752
  },
  "Every event starts with an opening talk, about ten minutes before the doors open.": {
   "file": "6b87c651031f1ed9.mp3",
   "ms": 4848
  },
  "Everyone gathers to hear the manager. That's where you get the rules for this event: breaks, tables, and anything else.": {
   "file": "62ca7cb35f8609f4.mp3",
   "ms": 7104
  },
  "Every manager runs the event a little differently, so listen, and respect what your manager says.": {
   "file": "eadd1f1a40110d37.mp3",
   "ms": 6120
  },
  "Phones: only for emergencies or important notes in the WhatsApp group.": {
   "file": "944c9e7fe2234e1f.mp3",
   "ms": 4776
  },
  "No TikToks, no Reels, during the event. Respect the time, our customers, and your teammates.": {
   "file": "a8a81f0dfe6aade0.mp3",
   "ms": 6096
  },
  "Company Rides & Meals": {
   "file": "7d57fe285c94e823.mp3",
   "ms": 1752
  },
  "Every ride that belongs to the company, to and from the airport or any authorized ride, goes on the company Uber account.": {
   "file": "ed3df12eb96e2d27.mp3",
   "ms": 7776
  },
  "Never use the company account for a personal ride, even during the event weekend.": {
   "file": "ce10f46b2cd0bd65.mp3",
   "ms": 5160
  },
  "Lunch is on the company.": {
   "file": "2a274314b903fad0.mp3",
   "ms": 1752
  },
  "Coffee on the company is a bonus. Your manager will announce it when it fits, not every day. The same goes for a bonus dinner.": {
   "file": "d08738ec34d837a6.mp3",
   "ms": 7896
  },
  "Team Communication & Morale": {
   "file": "a6aa13311c2235b6.mp3",
   "ms": 2136
  },
  "We spend long event weekends together, so the way we talk to each other really matters.": {
   "file": "bac8ded3caafe7bb.mp3",
   "ms": 4896
  },
  "Communicate clearly and kindly with every teammate, on the floor and off it.": {
   "file": "bcdfdbac339a82bd.mp3",
   "ms": 4608
  },
  "Be nice to each other. Good morale on the team makes the whole event better.": {
   "file": "5b8750cda87d38cf.mp3",
   "ms": 4464
  },
  "Know when it's right to point something out to a teammate, and when it's not. A small tip, said kindly and quietly, can help.": {
   "file": "784b1242b7957d5e.mp3",
   "ms": 7296
  },
  "But never call out a teammate in front of guests, or in a way that embarrasses them.": {
   "file": "9ad7354c4d3a7bcf.mp3",
   "ms": 4824
  },
  "If there is an ongoing problem with a teammate, don't try to solve it on your own. Bring it to your manager.": {
   "file": "f7711c4bce6abedf.mp3",
   "ms": 5952
  },
  "Cash Is on All of Us": {
   "file": "672537b459c6d7ec.mp3",
   "ms": 1608
  },
  "The cash in the registers is the whole team's responsibility.": {
   "file": "c1360e0d6bb73c03.mp3",
   "ms": 3960
  },
  "Keep every register safe. A register is never left open, and never left alone.": {
   "file": "960a1c281f75d485.mp3",
   "ms": 5376
  },
  "Give exact change, every time. Count it carefully before you hand it over.": {
   "file": "7f71f32b8f17aff8.mp3",
   "ms": 4608
  },
  "Check for fake bills whenever something feels off, and always on any bill over fifty dollars.": {
   "file": "fe78278cfc6e1362.mp3",
   "ms": 5472
  },
  "This is a personal and a shared responsibility of every person on the team.": {
   "file": "f17f13eed3a18aa5.mp3",
   "ms": 4656
  },
  "If cash is missing, the missing amount comes out of the bonus, split equally between everyone. So please, pay attention!": {
   "file": "0c2df7e3b8721583.mp3",
   "ms": 7512
  },
  "Sunday, Respect & Zero Tolerance": {
   "file": "180764890afa9179.mp3",
   "ms": 2640
  },
  "Sunday breakdown: pack every product correctly. A messy pack means a hard setup at the next event.": {
   "file": "5171b85e29412fe8.mp3",
   "ms": 6384
  },
  "After the event, respect your coworkers' rooms and personal space. No boundaries crossed.": {
   "file": "52695fc12a47a598.mp3",
   "ms": 5640
  },
  "Zero tolerance: no alcohol and no drugs during work time. Ever.": {
   "file": "c76853b7c9354610.mp3",
   "ms": 4872
  },
  "Breaking this rule means immediate termination.": {
   "file": "7a9ffd63395ff3a0.mp3",
   "ms": 2976
  },
  "That's the crew course! Thank you for being part of our team. The better we work together, the better our events are.": {
   "file": "82d6952bc2c5e39a.mp3",
   "ms": 6480
  },
  "Lead by Example": {
   "file": "e8b07621473ba6e5.mp3",
   "ms": 1512
  },
  "As a manager, the most important thing is to be a leader and set an example.": {
   "file": "75512fea2122216a.mp3",
   "ms": 4704
  },
  "Always in uniform, always on time. The team should admire and respect you.": {
   "file": "068a8a9fbbe2df4d.mp3",
   "ms": 4872
  },
  "Say the right things, the things that are in the best interest of the company.": {
   "file": "760286d968284268.mp3",
   "ms": 4248
  },
  "When the owners arrive, be respectful, and help with any extra requests they have.": {
   "file": "6227b4712c0db74e.mp3",
   "ms": 5088
  },
  "If Eli or Lauren are at the setup, check with them before you announce to the team that the day is done.": {
   "file": "39fd1d497596425d.mp3",
   "ms": 5928
  },
  "Train the New Ones": {
   "file": "3e50a705ed781f9a.mp3",
   "ms": 1392
  },
  "New employees learn during setup and through their first events, and that's on you.": {
   "file": "ec86097d4acc81a7.mp3",
   "ms": 4608
  },
  "They learn every brand and every corner of the room: Market, She, Amuse, Beauty Creation, hair, skin care.": {
   "file": "2006cbe03364200c.mp3",
   "ms": 6960
  },
  "Refills, go-backs, counts, and organizing the back stock under the tables, where it is supposed to be.": {
   "file": "88075110c163da79.mp3",
   "ms": 6528
  },
  "And when the time is right, the cash register.": {
   "file": "b350205980585313.mp3",
   "ms": 2736
  },
  "Our goal: everyone knows how to do everything.": {
   "file": "de5e4807dec43142.mp3",
   "ms": 2808
  },
  "Run the Floor": {
   "file": "769caf5ed63e5363.mp3",
   "ms": 1296
  },
  "About ten minutes before the doors open, gather the whole team for the opening talk.": {
   "file": "377457dc963c7c58.mp3",
   "ms": 4968
  },
  "That's where you set the rules for this event: breaks, the register rotation, who has which tables, and who is new on the team.": {
   "file": "ec45ffe951b0445c.mp3",
   "ms": 7416
  },
  "Your place is on the floor, about eighty percent of the time. Not at the register.": {
   "file": "d44f134a5c497b8d.mp3",
   "ms": 5040
  },
  "Know where everything is happening, and keep everyone as busy as possible.": {
   "file": "d9d165021d9a5260.mp3",
   "ms": 4488
  },
  "Know the register app better than anyone: creating new items, scanning barcodes, all of it.": {
   "file": "d3c14fdda29bfdbb.mp3",
   "ms": 5568
  },
  "Inventory Control": {
   "file": "156ee1a5fbaa7937.mp3",
   "ms": 1656
  },
  "Inventory control is one of the most important parts of your job.": {
   "file": "059e6657e299173a.mp3",
   "ms": 4176
  },
  "Do random checkups on anything that looks weird, like a minus in the system while the product is on the table.": {
   "file": "8f078e4c1177e2fd.mp3",
   "ms": 6696
  },
  "Recount it, and update the quantity in the RECOUNT count report.": {
   "file": "57412a0e6bc14994.mp3",
   "ms": 3840
  },
  "What matters most: during the weekend, every product on the RECOUNT list is counted before the event ends. Otherwise products will be missing the next week.": {
   "file": "8d6917e13d8e0d40.mp3",
   "ms": 9192
  },
  "Cash Control": {
   "file": "823384e3efcd9f68.mp3",
   "ms": 1344
  },
  "Managers, you watch over the registers, and make sure everything that happens with the cash is handled responsibly.": {
   "file": "79a57980621fc153.mp3",
   "ms": 6672
  },
  "At the end of every day, make sure the cash you have matches that day's cash total.": {
   "file": "d8851ff52b5771ad.mp3",
   "ms": 4608
  },
  "If anything is missing, tell us first. Don't tell the team before we talk and look at the situation together.": {
   "file": "773afacb7f43cd60.mp3",
   "ms": 6528
  },
  "As cash builds up during the event, keep it in the safest place there is, like the safe in your hotel room.": {
   "file": "08678500b89e5836.mp3",
   "ms": 6528
  },
  "If you keep it on you, your bag stays in the safest spot. Never in the back. Always where you can see it.": {
   "file": "d5aab317cd9b0ea1.mp3",
   "ms": 6336
  },
  "You share the team's collective responsibility for the cash, just like everyone. And we trust you!": {
   "file": "553605847db36d6c.mp3",
   "ms": 5760
  },
  "Supplies, Signs & Cameras": {
   "file": "7cd7e5a28f4c9a72.mp3",
   "ms": 2184
  },
  "The team never runs out: tape, sharpies, knives, the round neon tester stickers, neon signs, change, pens and price labels.": {
   "file": "ef88d75bdc539989.mp3",
   "ms": 8448
  },
  "Running low? Refill it with the company card. No delays for the next event!": {
   "file": "45069c1ccd59571c.mp3",
   "ms": 4728
  },
  "Every deal gets a bright neon sign with clear black sharpie: palettes, hair tools, skin care, clearance, buy two get one, perfumes.": {
   "file": "6ce6ce72043784d0.mp3",
   "ms": 8736
  },
  "Cameras: two, on opposite sides of the room, visible for the whole event.": {
   "file": "c6aa46125a937eda.mp3",
   "ms": 4608
  },
  "Installed on Thursday at setup, and connected until Sunday at five P M.": {
   "file": "73c88459c08d92c3.mp3",
   "ms": 4824
  },
  "Communication & Morale": {
   "file": "63d607da1d626c1d.mp3",
   "ms": 1824
  },
  "You are the link between the team and the owners, on anything that has to do with the business.": {
   "file": "2d482a0ad46b1a9b.mp3",
   "ms": 5184
  },
  "And when something bothers people with each other, you are the one who handles it.": {
   "file": "3f08d3cb8f924f96.mp3",
   "ms": 4248
  },
  "Keep the morale high, and support the owners in front of the team.": {
   "file": "862fa95a93e18584.mp3",
   "ms": 3768
  },
  "Even when a mistake was made, criticism is professional, and private when needed.": {
   "file": "3c721a44d0604e48.mp3",
   "ms": 5040
  },
  "The team should always feel that we are all on the same team. You did it, manager!": {
   "file": "75e075f80091a1b4.mp3",
   "ms": 4728
  },
  "Great job! Now, one quick question.": {
   "file": "ea5424df48233a83.mp3",
   "ms": 2520
  }
 }
}
